    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_c1dbe2ac10835b833aa1b65c058a6edaf4d33514d08a66a5091d5150bc7b7fdd",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The recurrence moments form a representation hub: inverse recurrence coefficients become weighted excursions and 2-3 trees, Lagrange inversion and contour jumps yield coefficient and positive-density formulas, and beta-integral manipulations yield fractional-binomial expressions; taking the critical Hankel determinant then converts the moment integral into a Macdonald-type multiple integral and a finite expansion in explicit binomial quantities.",
